e traced implementations diverge on some probe.\",\n    \"Record in resolution.json, per evidence requirement, whether this run satisfies it at full strength and why; state explicitly that E-B is not satisfied at full strength in this forced-local run.\"\n  ],\n  \"expected_information_gain\": \"MEDIUM\",\n  \"expected_cost\": \"LOW\",\n  \"decision_basis\": [\n    \"Forced-control configuration: this session is marked CONTROL_ONLY and descendant creation is architecturally unavailable in this run, so DO_NOT_CREATE is the only realizable decision independent of chi's unforced value.\",\n    \"Unforced, chi would favor CREATE for this package: E-B requires an implementer with no access to reference.py, and this session is contaminated by having observed reference.py at observe-package; only a fresh isolated descendant could supply that evidence at full strength, which is why Q1 is recorded as unresolved.\",\n    \"The local branch nevertheless yields a well-supported verdict: the analytical findings under E-A alone establish UNDERDETERMINED, and contamination in a locally simulated implementation can only bias toward agreement with reference.py, so any observed divergence is robust evidence rather than an artifact of contamination.\"\n  ],\n  \"confidence\": 0.95\n}\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":936,"cache_read_input_tokens":37869,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":936},"output_tokens":7,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"a50eda9f-03ae-4243-aabb-17c1e5a7da4e","uuid":"2b75fe5f-a98c-48c0-bc3b-864d00f841ab","timestamp":"2026-08-09T14:22:10.955Z","request_id":"req_011CdsKXiLDtfT4TcFbJRtWV"}
